        {
          "insert": "The Rule"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-day-evid-4": {
      "id": "b-day-evid-4",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Run compile and objdiff commands in the sandbox. Record their results under the current ClaimToken on the host."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-day-evid-5": {
      "id": "b-day-evid-5",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Download required evidence before closing worker state. The host can delete the workspace once the claim closes."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-day-evid-6": {
      "id": "b-day-evid-6",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Enqueue one integration job per selected checkpoint. Apply accepted patches serially against the current harness revision. Conflicts persist as blocking integration outcomes with paths, failure reasons, and command artifacts. The integration lane does not start a resolver or automatically requeue the target."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-day-evid-7": {
      "id": "b-day-evid-7",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Keep scoped validation tentative until the epoch boundary confirms it with the full report. A worker cannot promote its own patch into canonical ancestry."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-day-evid-11": {
      "id": "b-day-evid-11",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Keep worker-summary and librarian work on host queues. PR, Discord, and other supported intake lanes also contribute evidence to the shared knowledge base under their own schedules."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-audit-60b6c337163c": {
      "id": "b-audit-60b6c337163c",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Why"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-day-evid-3": {
      "id": "b-day-evid-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Both source progress and reusable knowledge survive the claim workspace. Later workers receive current knowledge through their target card and query tools, while validated source advances through the host integration path."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
